  <data key="d2">The Changjian-100 (Dongfeng-100) is a supersonic cruise missile developed by the People's Liberation Army of China, representing the third generation of the Changjian series missiles. It features strong penetration capability, high命中精度, large operational radius, and fast response speed.</data>
