<node id="China">
  <data key="d0">China</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">China is the country that developed the Dongfeng-15, Changjian series missiles, and GJ-11 drone.&lt;SEP&gt;The nation responsible for the research, development, and production of the JY-27A, YLC-2, and Hongqi-9 systems.&lt;SEP&gt;China is the country where the Hongqi-9 and Hongqi-16 systems were researched, developed, and deployed.&lt;SEP&gt;China is the nation responsible for developing and manufacturing the Hongqi-17, Hongqi-19, and Hongqi-22 systems.</data>
