  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cold launch is the propulsion method where missiles are ejected from the tube by gas injection before engine ignition.&lt;SEP&gt;Cold Launch is a missile ejection technique where the missile is ejected from the tube before engine ignition to reduce pressure.</data>
