  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Type 055 Destroyer is a new generation of missile destroyer developed by China, with a full load displacement of approximately 12,000 tons, equipped with 130mm main guns and 112 missile vertical launch systems.&lt;SEP&gt;055型驱逐舰是中国研制的新一代导弹驱逐舰，满载排水量约12000吨，装备130毫米主炮和112单元导弹垂直发射系统，具有较强的信息感知、防空反导和对海打击能力。</data>
