<node id="中国">
  <data key="d0">中国</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">China is the country that developed and built the aircraft carriers and destroyers mentioned in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;中国是研制这些导弹和战机的国家。&lt;SEP&gt;中国是中华人民共和国的主体国家，研发和装备了多种远程火箭炮系统。&lt;SEP&gt;中国是研发和生产这些导弹的国家。&lt;SEP&gt;China conducts anti-satellite laser experiments using the Shenguang series and manufactures various radar systems including JYL-1A and JY-27.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b31480a7e7df34735416e7d28a9105d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19abd266427cf2f523ed74abe4c7fe08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d66dea93b10874b191162cbdb0ab98a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-038ddf1e5bbffbc2d8cad08f0e6438a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ddaaa964e9f453ec408e945b3af0cf2</data>
