  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Type 901 Replenishment Ship is a large comprehensive replenishment ship developed by China for the People's Liberation Army Navy, capable of providing at-sea replenishment to aircraft carrier formations and distant sea maneuver formations.</data>
