  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Type 903A Replenishment Ship is an improved version of the Type 903 Replenishment Ship, with a full load displacement of 23,000 tons, capable of carrying 10,500 tons of fuel, 250 tons of fresh water, and 680 tons of dry cargo and ammunition.</data>
