  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The YJ-12 Anti-Ship Missile is a supersonic anti-ship missile equipped by the People's Liberation Army of China, the first domestically developed supersonic anti-ship missile and one of China's fourth-generation anti-ship missiles.</data>
