  <data key="d2">The YJ-18C Missile is a missile developed by China, displayed at the military parade commemorating the 80th anniversary of the Victory of the People's War of Resistance Against Japanese Aggression and the World Anti-Fascist War on September 3, 2025.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-757015f89d4c935f7724a9ed12087838</data>
