  <data key="d0">YJ-21 Missile</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The YJ-21 Missile is a hypersonic anti-ship missile developed by China. It was first publicly displayed in April 2022 when the Type 055 destroyer launched it. The missile can reach speeds of 10 Mach and features a snake-like maneuver capability for attacking aircraft carrier decks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-757015f89d4c935f7724a9ed12087838</data>
